 Test Results Summary:
  - 10 different MMSIs tested: Only 1 vessel found (10% success rate)
  - Successful case: MMSI 636023801 (MSC LAUSANNE VI) - likely accidental general traffic
  - Failed cases: Including MMSI 256506000 tested multiple times while confirmed transmitting

  Key Evidence:
