  Conclusion

  The AISstream FiltersShipMMSI parameter appears to be fundamentally broken or extremely unreliable. Geographic filtering works perfectly, but
  MMSI-specific filtering fails ~90% of the time even when vessels are confirmed to be transmitting. The one successful case was likely receiving
  unfiltered general traffic due to a malformed subscription that AISstream ignored.
